  - m_Id: 2041606569989
    m_Localized: Travel vlogger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569990
    m_Localized: Nature photographer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569991
    m_Localized: Fitness influencer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569992
    m_Localized: Food blogger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569993
    m_Localized: DJ and music producer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569994
    m_Localized: Bestselling author
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569995
    m_Localized: Football star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569996
    m_Localized: Celebrity chef
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569997
    m_Localized: Movie star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569998
    m_Localized: Pop star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606569999
    m_Localized: She films videos from exotic destinations for half a million followers. A cosy hotel and a beautiful view are all she needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570000
    m_Localized: He photographs sunsets and tropical wildlife for travel magazines. After a full day of photography, he enjoys a drink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570001
    m_Localized: Morning workouts, healthy smoothies and poolside stories. She won't come without a pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570002
    m_Localized: He reviews restaurants around the world. His review can bring crowds of guests to the resort.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570003
    m_Localized: He plays at the biggest beach parties. He wants a top-class bar and a pool for the after-party.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570004
    m_Localized: She is coming to the island to finish her new book. She needs peace, wellness and a comfortable hotel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570005
    m_Localized: The national team captain is enjoying a holiday after the season. He expects a luxury hotel and the best pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570006
    m_Localized: He owns award-winning restaurants and stars in cooking shows. He will inspect every kitchen and bar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570007
    m_Localized: A major film star looking for privacy and relaxation. She will accept only a luxury hotel with the best wellness facilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570008
    m_Localized: The world's most famous singer. Her visit will make the resort famous, but everything must be perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570009
    m_Localized: Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2041606570010
